# GitHub push

Unless the user says not to publish a change, commit it and push it to git@github.com:fishmaple/e2e-obsidian-sync-client.git `main`.

Commit messages are English. Keep the existing git author. Do not add an AI or Co-authored-by trailer.

Do not commit `server/`, `README.md`, `docs/`, or `server/.deploy.local.env`. Do not change git config. Do not force-push.
